  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Two-player game: 4 bouts of 30 seconds, one per scene, points only as score. The higher score wins and can set high_score_2p. Called by the title loop."},
    {"at":70,"placement":"side","text":"Compares the score digits; X = winner, $80 = equal."},
    {"at":75,"placement":"side","text":"Equal scores: both bow, and player 1's score goes to the high score test."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"side","text":"Lone RTS with the winner in X."},
    {"at":95,"placement":"line","text":"One two-player bout: exchanges until the time ends. Each hit gives score points to the other player and clears the yin-yang cells. Called by game_two_players."},
    {"at":100,"placement":"side","text":"Each reaction move has bit 4 set: the EOR finds a hit of exactly one fighter."},
    {"at":140,"placement":"line","text":"One-player game against the computer from NOVICE up. Two won bouts give the next rank and a stronger opponent. Returns A = 0 after the lost bout."},
    {"at":146,"placement":"side","text":"Rank index, also cpu_skill of fighter 1."},
    {"at":171,"placement":"side","text":"Clears the last digit of the player 2 score."},
    {"at":176,"placement":"side","text":"Seeds ai_random from the frame counter."},
    {"at":252,"placement":"side","text":"The only rank limit: stage_counter $16, after 22 promotions."},
    {"at":256,"placement":"side","text":"Rank index and AI level of fighter 1 go up together."},
    {"at":270,"placement":"side","text":"The table has 12 entries; ranks 12-22 read code bytes from $1d48 on."},
    {"at":300,"placement":"side","text":"After 22 promotions: scenes go on, the rank text stays and the AI level is random 2-10."},
    {"at":322,"placement":"line","text":"One-player bout: exchanges until a fighter has 4 half points or the time ends. Returns A: 1 won, 0 lost, $81 draw, $80 key."},
    {"at":341,"placement":"side","text":"Tie-break value of fighter 1, with the hit points of fighter 0."},
    {"at":418,"placement":"line","text":"Attract demo: two computer fighters with random levels 3-11 fight 4 bouts, one per scene. Returns N set when a start key or fire ends it."},
    {"at":506,"placement":"line","text":"One demo bout: exchanges until a fighter has 4 half points or the time ends. No score. Returns A = 0, or $80 with N set on a start key."},
    {"at":550,"placement":"line","text":"Adds hit_points of fighter X to half_points and draws the yin-yang symbols for 1-4 half points. Returns C set when the fighter has 4."},
    {"at":677,"placement":"line","text":"Draws a whole yin-yang symbol (characters 1-4, 2 x 2) at $cc03+Y. Called by add_half_points."},
    {"at":698,"placement":"line","text":"Draws a half yin-yang symbol (characters 5-8, 2 x 2) at $cc03+Y. Called by add_half_points."},
    {"at":719,"placement":"line","text":"Clears both yin-yang symbols of a fighter, Y = 0 for fighter 0 or $1d for fighter 1. Called at the start of each bout and by bout_2p_exchanges."},
    {"at":746,"placement":"line","text":"Starts animation $19 (the bow) for fighter X on the ground. Called by bow_winner and bow_both."},
    {"at":761,"placement":"line","text":"Plays the bow of fighter X frame by frame until it ends. Called after a won bout in each mode."},
    {"at":779,"placement":"line","text":"Both fighters bow; waits for the end of the bow of fighter 1. Called after a draw."}
  ],
